  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "최상의 코디네이트를\n경험해 보세요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CC0C1C7580020CF54B514B124C774D2B8B97C000AACBDD5D8D5740020BCF4C138C694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저로 말할 것 같으면\n월드 클래스의 패션 코디네이터!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B85C0020B9D0D5600020AC830020AC19C73CBA74000AC6D4B4DC0020D074B798C2A4C7580020D328C1580020CF54B514B124C774D130002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런 제가\n지금 주목하고 있는 것은...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F00020C81CAC00000AC9C0AE080020C8FCBAA9D558ACE00020C788B2940020AC83C740002E002E002E00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 당신!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020B2F9C2E0002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 만남을 기념하는 차원에서\n전신을 코디해 드리겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020B9CCB0A8C7440020AE30B150D558B2940020CC28C6D0C5D0C11C000AC804C2E0C7440020CF54B514D5740020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안심하세요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n패션 아이템은 대여해 드리는 것이지만\n요금은 일절 받지 않으니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C2ECD558C138C694002E00100001BE01000AD328C1580020C544C774D15CC7400020B300C5ECD5740020B4DCB9ACB2940020AC83C774C9C0B9CC000AC694AE08C7400020C77CC8080020BC1BC9C00020C54AC73CB2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 그럼 이제...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020ADF8B7FC0020C774C81C002E002E002E00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 패션을 머리부터 발끝까지\n코디해 드려도 될까요!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020D328C158C7440020BA38B9ACBD80D1300020BC1CB05DAE4CC9C0000ACF54B514D5740020B4DCB824B3C40020B420AE4CC6940021003F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드려요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB824C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아아... 남의 선택에 의해 펼쳐지는 가능성을\n시험해 보려고도 하지 않다니...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C544002E002E002E0020B0A8C7580020C120D0DDC5D00020C758D5740020D3BCCCD0C9C0B2940020AC00B2A5C131C744000AC2DCD5D8D5740020BCF4B824ACE0B3C40020D558C9C00020C54AB2E4B2C8002E002E002E002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먼저 주의 사항을 하나 알려 드리죠.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n다른 의상으로 갈아입으셔도 괜찮지만\n그땐 코디해 드린 의상을 반납받을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n자, 계속하시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둘게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB458AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오케이!\n그럼, 최상의 코디네이트를 경험해 보세요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624CF00C7740021000AADF8B7FC002C0020CD5CC0C1C7580020CF54B514B124C774D2B8B97C0020ACBDD5D8D5740020BCF4C138C6940021002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 제 코디네이트네요! 당신은 지금\n미르에서 유일무이한 존재가 되었어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020C81C0020CF54B514B124C774D2B8B124C69400210020B2F9C2E0C7400020C9C0AE08000ABBF8B974C5D0C11C0020C720C77CBB34C774D55C0020C874C7ACAC000020B418C5C8C5B4C694002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 내일 아침까지\n저의 코디네이트를 즐기도록 하세요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n다음에 또 봐요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020B0B4C77C0020C544CE68AE4CC9C0000AC800C7580020CF54B514B124C774D2B8B97C0020C990AE30B3C4B85D0020D558C138C694002E00100001BE01000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020BD10C694002E00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빌린 의상을 반납하겠습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE4CB9B00020C758C0C1C7440020BC18B0A9D558ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "반납한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC18B0A9D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "반납하지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC18B0A9D558C9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빌린 의상을 반납하기 전까지\n새로 의상을 구입할 수 없습니다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE4CB9B00020C758C0C1C7440020BC18B0A9D558AE300020C804AE4CC9C0000AC0C8B85C0020C758C0C1C7440020AD6CC785D5600020C2180020C5C6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 해 드리는 코디네이트는 하루에 한 번!\n또 이용하고 싶으시다면 내일 다시 오세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
